WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.830
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.100 --> 00:03.080
The truth is, I...

3
00:06.965 --> 00:09.495
I like men.

4
00:14.040 --> 00:16.090
You're lying, right?

5
00:17.430 --> 00:19.150
Sui...

6
00:28.320 --> 00:30.300
Thanks for the food!

7
00:34.254 --> 00:37.294
You're in an awfully good mood.

8
00:39.475 --> 00:41.365
Oh, I know why.

9
00:42.004 --> 00:44.974
Was it something after the festival?

10
00:44.974 --> 00:46.654
Not really.

11
00:48.414 --> 00:52.444
It's about that senpai of yours anyway, isn't it?

12
00:57.014 --> 00:59.768
[Sui Kishida]

13
01:10.444 --> 01:13.214
Good, you're here.

14
01:13.214 --> 01:14.674
Huh?

15
01:15.744 --> 01:18.064
Your tag says you're out.

16
01:18.064 --> 01:21.064
Oh, I forgot to flip it back.

17
01:23.234 --> 01:26.154
Sorry. Now's not a good time.

18
01:29.614 --> 01:31.144
Sorry.

19
01:41.204 --> 01:42.984
Did something happen?

20
01:42.984 --> 01:45.814
No, it's nothing.

21
01:45.814 --> 01:49.384
- But it looks like... - Really.

22
01:49.384 --> 01:52.203
I'm just tired from studying.

23
01:53.594 --> 01:55.174
Sui!

24
02:02.104 --> 02:04.904
You wouldn't understand, Harutora.

25
02:04.904 --> 02:06.354
Huh?

26
03:16.694 --> 03:18.824
What are you doing?

27
03:18.824 --> 03:21.764
Qualifiers for the nationals are tomorrow.

28
03:21.764 --> 03:23.224
Let's go home.

29
03:32.484 --> 03:34.694
I see.

30
03:36.074 --> 03:39.516
Sui won't tell you anything?

31
03:47.674 --> 03:50.664
We just need to give him space.

32
03:51.564 --> 03:52.964
Huh?

33
03:53.744 --> 03:58.994
All you can do right now is win tomorrow's game.

34
04:00.684 --> 04:02.724
You've got no choice.

35
04:06.254 --> 04:09.694
Because if you're not at your best,

36
04:09.694 --> 04:14.274
Sui will probably feel even more responsible, right?

37
04:18.734 --> 04:20.454
Right?

38
04:20.454 --> 04:22.124
That's true.

39
04:30.774 --> 04:33.244
What a waste.

40
04:33.244 --> 04:35.044
You're throwing it away?

41
04:38.184 --> 04:41.594
The qualifiers for the nationals start tomorrow, right?

42
04:46.464 --> 04:48.141
Come on.

43
04:51.874 --> 04:54.464
Seriously, stop doing stuff like that.

44
04:54.464 --> 04:56.684
That's not what I meant.

45
04:59.064 --> 05:01.654
I'm telling you that you should...

46
05:02.854 --> 05:04.784
give it to him.

47
05:10.784 --> 05:13.114
Don't end up like me.

48
05:14.774 --> 05:17.284
Better to regret doing it...

49
05:19.554 --> 05:23.634
than to regret not doing it.

50
05:24.408 --> 05:25.698
Huh?

51
05:33.544 --> 05:38.304
Anyway, I'm sorry... about the other day.

52
05:38.304 --> 05:42.824
I heard gay couples don't last long, so don't get too attached!

53
05:58.204 --> 06:00.266
[Basketball Championships]

54
06:21.964 --> 06:24.734
Yes! They won!

55
06:25.644 --> 06:28.704
Wow, that was amazing, Harutora.

56
06:31.184 --> 06:33.344
Isn't number 8 from Sofu so cool?

57
06:33.344 --> 06:34.874
Sofu?

58
06:34.874 --> 06:36.904
His name's Harutora Kurobe.

59
06:36.904 --> 06:38.044
Oh, really?

60
06:38.044 --> 06:39.444
Wait, isn't that him?

61
06:39.444 --> 06:42.324
You saw him too? I knew it!

62
06:42.324 --> 06:44.534
Sui.

63
06:44.534 --> 06:46.884
H-Harutora?

64
06:50.614 --> 06:52.334
Thank goodness!

65
06:53.644 --> 06:56.184
I thought you weren't coming...

66
06:57.824 --> 07:00.253
Wait... Harutora...

67
07:00.253 --> 07:01.774
The lemons.

68
07:01.774 --> 07:03.616
Thank you.

69
07:04.644 --> 07:07.224
They kept me going.

70
07:09.194 --> 07:11.824
S-Sorry.

71
07:12.464 --> 07:16.494
Sorry, I know this is an important time for you.

72
07:17.584 --> 07:19.824
It's okay.

73
07:19.824 --> 07:23.464
I understand you, Sui.

74
07:27.374 --> 07:31.224
Also, I saved you a seat right over there.

75
07:33.074 --> 07:35.992
[Reserved Seat]

76
07:40.894 --> 07:42.854
Let's go, Harutora.

77
07:44.694 --> 07:47.594
Keep cheering for us, okay?

78
07:47.594 --> 07:49.004
Okay.

79
07:50.124 --> 07:51.764
Harutora.

80
08:12.904 --> 08:17.044
Actually, I told my mom.

81
08:17.044 --> 08:18.774
That I'm gay.

82
08:21.984 --> 08:25.354
I'm sorry for taking it out on you the other day.

83
08:26.824 --> 08:28.244
It's fine.

84
08:29.004 --> 08:30.994
I was upset.

85
08:32.164 --> 08:34.284
And hurt.

86
08:36.892 --> 08:39.911
I didn't think at all...

87
08:41.814 --> 08:46.464
about how my mom would feel going home that day.

88
08:53.674 --> 08:55.104
So...

89
08:56.604 --> 09:00.874
So I think I'll try talking to her again.

90
09:03.294 --> 09:05.844
I'll apologize for shocking her.

91
09:07.824 --> 09:09.279
But...

92
09:10.643 --> 09:12.854
I want her to know...

93
09:16.044 --> 09:19.624
that I've found someone important too.

94
09:22.354 --> 09:24.414
Aren't you pushing yourself?

95
09:25.244 --> 09:27.034
Pushing myself...

96
09:30.044 --> 09:31.554
But...

97
09:36.114 --> 09:39.304
She could at least understand, right?

98
09:39.304 --> 09:43.564
Like "that took courage", or "you did your best".

99
09:43.564 --> 09:45.674
She could at least...

100
09:47.212 --> 09:48.812
say that much.

101
09:50.364 --> 09:52.184
She's my mother...

102
10:00.604 --> 10:02.314
It's okay.

103
10:04.654 --> 10:06.014
For me,

104
10:06.994 --> 10:10.334
it all began after I met you, Sui.

105
10:11.534 --> 10:14.374
My life began...

106
10:15.274 --> 10:17.754
after I met you, Sui.

107
10:20.674 --> 10:22.724
So you'll be fine.

108
10:45.884 --> 10:46.994
Here.

109
10:47.856 --> 10:50.164
Mom, I wanted to talk about...

110
10:50.164 --> 10:51.954
Sui!

111
10:51.954 --> 10:55.924
So, your father was relocated to Osaka for work.

112
10:55.924 --> 10:57.204
Huh?

113
10:57.204 --> 11:00.638
Oh, right. I already told you that.

114
11:01.452 --> 11:04.498
I need to drop off the neighborhood binder.

115
11:06.404 --> 11:08.064
Mom!

116
11:12.297 --> 11:13.404
Hey, so...

117
11:13.404 --> 11:16.305
I'm gonna run out to get some groceries.

118
11:16.984 --> 11:18.284
Okay.

119
11:19.154 --> 11:20.583
Mom.

120
11:22.834 --> 11:25.864
There's a Korean drama I wanted to watch.

121
11:25.864 --> 11:27.544
I see.

122
11:43.504 --> 11:45.214
[Harutora]

123
11:45.214 --> 11:48.294
[This is Suzuki.]

124
11:48.294 --> 11:49.814
Suzuki?

125
11:57.144 --> 11:58.644
Dai-chan?

126
12:01.096 --> 12:05.194
[I love you, Sui.]

127
12:05.194 --> 12:07.914
"I love you, Sui".

128
12:10.174 --> 12:13.884
Honestly, Harutora...

129
12:15.934 --> 12:17.544
I'm home.

130
12:17.544 --> 12:20.964
Welcome back, Mom. About that talk...

131
12:29.634 --> 12:34.404
How did you know that I had a fever?

132
12:38.764 --> 12:42.584
Maybe it's from living in the dorm.

133
12:42.584 --> 12:43.904
Huh?

134
12:44.814 --> 12:46.894
Well, you know...

135
12:48.044 --> 12:52.104
After cooking for myself, cleaning,

136
12:52.104 --> 12:54.704
and talking with all kinds of people...

137
12:55.544 --> 13:03.434
I started noticing all sorts of things around me.

138
13:06.314 --> 13:12.268
Mom, I still can't tell if someone's sick the way you can,

139
13:12.268 --> 13:16.974
just from hearing their voice, but...

140
13:22.564 --> 13:27.864
Since that day... I tried doing my own research.

141
13:38.554 --> 13:41.704
Even though I understand it in my head,

142
13:42.914 --> 13:47.934
I think it'll still take time to truly accept it.

143
13:55.744 --> 13:59.054
But you know, Sui,

144
14:00.684 --> 14:05.224
I want you to be happy.

145
14:08.984 --> 14:15.874
You know, it was a miracle that I had you.

146
14:17.724 --> 14:22.744
I wanted to give up so many times, but couldn't.

147
14:24.054 --> 14:30.224
After all the pain I went through, I found you at the end.

148
14:33.294 --> 14:36.304
From the day you were born,

149
14:37.514 --> 14:41.694
we've been given more happiness than we could ever ask for.

150
14:43.344 --> 14:45.144
So, Sui.

151
14:46.784 --> 14:48.704
Promise me.

152
14:50.604 --> 14:54.624
That you'll be happy, no matter what.

153
14:56.234 --> 15:01.064
No matter what path you choose, you will find happiness.

154
15:01.064 --> 15:03.884
Just promise me that much.

155
15:12.524 --> 15:14.424
I got it.

156
15:18.364 --> 15:19.844
Mom.

157
15:23.104 --> 15:24.464
I...

158
15:25.564 --> 15:27.494
promise.

159
15:33.114 --> 15:34.584
You see,

160
15:35.814 --> 15:39.664
I have someone important to me right now.

161
15:41.794 --> 15:45.344
You mean you're dating someone?

162
15:45.344 --> 15:46.714
Yeah.

163
15:48.224 --> 15:50.634
Wait, who?

164
15:53.914 --> 15:55.804
This person.

165
15:59.418 --> 16:02.028
I knew it!

166
16:02.974 --> 16:05.514
How did you know?

167
16:05.514 --> 16:09.664
I'm your mother, aren't I?

168
16:14.094 --> 16:15.254
Right.

169
16:15.254 --> 16:18.054
I see.

170
16:36.714 --> 16:38.564
It's me, Sui.

171
16:41.084 --> 16:43.004
What are you doing?

172
16:43.004 --> 16:44.482
I was waiting in front of the dorm,

173
16:44.482 --> 16:47.534
but people kept asking what I was doing.

174
16:47.534 --> 16:50.474
You waited for me this whole time?

175
16:50.474 --> 16:54.542
I was worried about how the family meeting went.

176
17:07.464 --> 17:09.449
It didn't go well, did it?

177
17:10.464 --> 17:11.824
Huh?

178
17:12.754 --> 17:15.004
Don't force yourself to smile.

179
17:15.004 --> 17:18.253
You can take it out on me.

180
17:19.554 --> 17:22.174
Wait, that's not it.

181
17:22.174 --> 17:26.904
The family meeting ended in the best possible way.

182
17:27.764 --> 17:31.894
I wanted to tell you properly later, Harutora.

183
17:32.624 --> 17:39.294
I still haven't told my dad, so I'm not totally in the clear,

184
17:39.294 --> 17:45.114
but my mom wishes for my happiness.

185
17:46.274 --> 17:48.534
Really?

186
17:48.534 --> 17:50.004
Yeah.

187
17:51.324 --> 17:53.010
My mom even wore

188
17:53.010 --> 17:57.434
the pumps I gave her years ago.

189
17:58.104 --> 18:01.134
From the parent-teacher conference?

190
18:01.134 --> 18:04.104
Yeah, I'm impressed you remember.

191
18:12.554 --> 18:14.054
You know...

192
18:16.114 --> 18:22.614
I told her honestly that I'm dating someone.

193
18:23.604 --> 18:27.814
When I said it was you, she was really happy.

194
18:29.594 --> 18:31.584
Really?

195
18:31.584 --> 18:33.044
Yeah.

196
18:38.514 --> 18:40.624
I'm glad...

197
18:41.394 --> 18:43.944
I'm so glad...

198
18:47.994 --> 18:50.244
Thank you.

199
18:50.244 --> 18:52.404
It's thanks to you, Harutora.

200
18:54.054 --> 18:58.357
No way. It's because of your hard work.

201
19:33.804 --> 19:34.964
Okay, Kishida.

202
19:34.964 --> 19:36.484
Yes.

203
19:45.324 --> 19:47.094
I'm Harutora Kurobe.

204
19:47.094 --> 19:48.804
A second-year.

205
19:48.804 --> 19:50.644
Sui...

206
19:50.644 --> 19:53.854
Sui is my boyfriend.

207
19:53.854 --> 19:59.924
My favorite food is the honey lemon Sui makes for me.

208
20:12.125 --> 20:13.129
We're friends, aren't we?

209
20:13.129 --> 20:14.797
That's not it.

210
20:14.797 --> 20:16.724
Senpai!

211
20:16.724 --> 20:19.882
You shouldn't make jokes like that.

212
20:20.714 --> 20:22.214
I'm kidding.

213
20:22.214 --> 20:23.594
I'm just kidding.

214
20:23.594 --> 20:25.324
I'm kidding.

215
20:46.134 --> 20:50.384
[Graduation Ceremony]

216
20:50.384 --> 20:56.174
[Aoba Dormitory]

217
20:56.174 --> 20:57.824
Sui.

218
20:58.764 --> 21:02.394
Congratulations on graduating.

219
21:03.284 --> 21:04.854
Thanks.

220
21:06.784 --> 21:09.334
Any thoughts on these three years?

221
21:17.514 --> 21:19.114
I'll miss it.

222
21:20.604 --> 21:21.914
Huh?

223
21:24.564 --> 21:26.894
I'll miss this place a lot.

224
21:33.164 --> 21:34.984
I'm glad to hear it.

225
21:42.214 --> 21:43.904
Harutora.

226
21:49.334 --> 21:50.784
I...

227
21:57.264 --> 21:59.714
I'm glad I was born as me.

228
22:04.764 --> 22:06.974
Really glad.

229
22:09.674 --> 22:11.378
Sui.

230
22:17.314 --> 22:21.364
Of course you are. That's a given.
